  <item>
    <title>SPACEVOICE 009 : SEE EYE TO EYE</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61a4aa333b129bf290e2db4c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61a4aa333b129bf290e2db4c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Nov 2021 10:23:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>很久没更新了，小宇宙成员桃夏夏做眼部手术归来，惊奇发现同事里可以集齐全飞秒、半飞秒、ICL晶体植入三种矫正手术的术后患者，各自分享了一下回忆中的手术，可能会给想了解但无从下手的你一点不用担心是否利益相关的信息。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> 半飞秒手术流程和感受 ——by 桃夏夏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 全飞秒手术流程和感受 ——by RayRay</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="801">13:21</a> &nbsp;ICL晶体植入手术流程和感受——by Yuqi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 把自己从远视看成近视的 —— 灰羊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2474">41:14</a> 神秘飞行嘉宾谈——by 神秘飞行嘉宾</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv3f2ibWyQ7D9N1VwG9x9o02fWba.m4a" length="56300198" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZqaWRSaTQ5Qy01TVQ0WkZxZnVkb0tpd1EwOFc="/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
