  <item>
    <title>SPACEVOICE 008: What Planet Is This</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/607306bc2af3a36966df4fb0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">607306bc2af3a36966df4fb0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Apr 2021 14:25:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2021年3月26号是小宇宙上线一周年，我们邀请了几位同事来聊了聊。</span></p><span></span><br><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 正片Part 1：大核桃、少女、娜娜和小熊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 小宇宙的来由 起名大会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 正片Part 2：芒芒、Tuesda、柏拉图和林航</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 给用户的话：何德何能，收到你们的小作文</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3910">1:05:10</a> 正片Part 3：鸡丝、镇长和香香鸡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3930">1:05:30</a> 鸡丝真情（客套）感言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4420">1:13:40</a> 设计师镇长对小宇宙设计的一些感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4710">1:18:30</a> 工程师香香鸡对新年规划卖的小关子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4900">1:21:40</a> 正片Part 4：多多、ouli和Poyet</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5290">1:28:10</a> 几位同事对于过去一年的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5668">1:34:28</a> 正片Part 5：XXD、Vic和Arthur</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6610">1:50:10</a> 正片Part 6：黎黎黎、狼外公、灰羊和明明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7750">2:09:10</a> 正片Part 7：深白色的独白</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liCirqs2DIi1JYPWXfpdYhwlrI6N.m4a" length="191093858" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:10:18</itunes:duration>
